   "1": {
    "skillId": 10067,
    "type": 0,
    "name": "Palm Vortex",
    "description": "Grasping the wind's might, you form a vortex of vacuum in your palm, causing continuous <color=#80FFD7FF>Anemo DMG</color> to opponents in front of you.\\nThe vacuum vortex explodes when the skill duration ends, causing a greater amount of Anemo DMG over a larger area.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Hold</color>\\nDMG and AoE will gradually increase.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Elemental Absorption</color>\\nIf the vortex comes into contact with <color=#80C0FFFF>Hydro</color>/<color=#FF9999FF>Pyro</color>/<color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo</color>/<color=#FFACFFFF>Electro</color>, it will deal additional elemental DMG of that type.\\nElemental Absorption may only occur once per use.\\n\\n<i>You discussed the way to grasp the formless wind with Paimon.</i>",
