    "name": "Foreign Windwrath",
    "description": "Draw new strength from journeys past. For every element you have resonated with, you gain additional {LINK#N10050001}<color=#FFD780FF>buffs</color>{/LINK}.\\n\\nAdditionally, when <color=#FF9999FF>Pyro</color>, <color=#80C0FFFF>Hydro</color>, <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo</color>, or <color=#FFACFFFF>Electro</color> attacks from nearby party members hit opponents, Traveler will receive 1 stack of Blade of the Dawn Breeze. Each Elemental Type can grant 1 Blade of the Dawn Breeze stack. After obtaining at least 2 stacks of Blade of the Dawn Breeze, performing a Charged Attack will consume all stacks of Blade of the Dawn Breeze and transform into the special <color=#FFD780FF>Charged Attack: Whirlwind</color>.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Charged Attack: Whirlwind</color>\\n· Each Charged Attack hit deals increased <color=#80FFD7FF>Anemo DMG</color>. Increase in DMG is equal to 60% of Traveler's ATK.\\n· Every time a Blade of the Dawn Breeze of a certain elemental type is consumed, a Blade Wind matching this elemental type will also be summoned, dealing elemental DMG equal to 50% of Traveler's ATK. This DMG is considered Charged Attack DMG.\\n· <color=#FFD780FF>Charged Attack: Whirlwind</color> can be triggered up to once every 15s.\\n· For the duration of <color=#FFD780FF>Charged Attack: Whirlwind</color>, no Blade of the Dawn Breeze will be obtained.",
